175
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,440
Yeah, I do.

176
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:31,120
I want you two to meet.

177
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,520
But I've been busy lately, so I don't have time.

178
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:34,440
You can't do that.

179
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:36,240
I'm free, so set it up.

180
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:39,400
Even if you ask when I'm busy,
I'll make myself free. I want to meet them.

181
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:43,720
I want to see the face of the person Peem loves.

182
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:45,920
How about this?

183
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,720
Let's meet up this evening.

184
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:51,440
Go reschedule things with your secretary,
and bring them to see me at the restaurant.

185
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:54,600
I think I need to touch up my makeup a bit.

186
00:13:38,520 --> 00:13:39,560
She's not answering.

187
00:13:48,280 --> 00:13:50,480
Excuse me. Where's Parn?

188
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,360
