I know I was wrong.

266
00:21:51,280 --> 00:21:52,640
What did you do wrong?

267
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:54,920
Going to the hotel with Techin?

268
00:21:55,320 --> 00:21:56,880
Lying to me?

269
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:59,720
Or coming back here to work?

270
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:01,080
You deceived me.

271
00:22:01,600 --> 00:22:03,080
You think I'm stupid?

272
00:22:03,840 --> 00:22:05,480
I didn't mean to deceive you.

273
00:22:06,600 --> 00:22:08,520
I'm just helping her out temporarily.

274
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:09,920
She really has no money.

275
00:22:10,840 --> 00:22:11,920
And about Mr. Techin,

276
00:22:12,360 --> 00:22:13,800
it's not what you think.

277
00:22:13,800 --> 00:22:16,800
Right. It's really not what I think.

278
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:19,560
I thought you stopped getting involved with him
when you started seeing me.

279
00:22:20,080 --> 00:22:21,880
But you didn't stop.

280
00:22:21,880 --> 00:22:23,200
You never stopped.

281
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:25,960
Ms. Peem.

282
00:22:35,280 --> 00:22:37,080
Pack your things and get out of my house.

283
00:22:37,080 --> 00:22:38,560
Get out of my life.

284
00:22:40,640 --> 00:22:42,320
I don't want to see you again.

285
00:23:17,600 --> 00:23:18,640
Parn!

286
00:23:21,760 --> 00:23:22,800
Parn.

287
00:23:43,440 --> 00:23:45,280
Sit down. I'll put this away for you.

288
00:23:45,720 --> 00:23:46,640
Sit.

289
00:24:03,960 --> 00:24:07,040
Do you want me to go tell her
you're helping me pay off my debt?

290
00:24:08,520 --> 00:24:11,560
I think that's a good idea.
She'll probably listen to her.

291
00:24:16,360 --> 00:24:17,520
I don't think you should

292
00:24:17,840 --> 00:24:19,400
Then what are you going to do?

293
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:21,160
If you go back to apologize,

294
00:24:21,160 --> 00:24:22,640
will she even listen to you?

295
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:25,040
I don't know.

296
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:33,520
I'll go home and talk to her, Sis.

297
00:24:43,240 --> 00:24:44,160
Ms. Peem.

298
00:25:04,360 --> 00:25:06,080
Can you promise me something, Parn?

299
00:25:08,040 --> 00:25:09,600
Promise me that you won't lie.

300
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:16,640
I don't know how long this happiness will last.

301
00:25:18,800 --> 00:25:20,080
It'll be long.

302
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:23,080
It could even last a lifetime.

303
00:25:32,040 --> 00:25:33,240
She lied about everything.

304
00:25:38,760 --> 00:25:41,040
Was there nothing real between us?

305
00:26:10,600 --> 00:26:11,560
Ms. Peem.

306
00:26:15,800 --> 00:26:22,920
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

307
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:25,920
♪ Why am I like this... ♪

308
00:26:25,920 --> 00:26:27,000
Is it good?

309
00:26:28,120 --> 00:26:30,880
♪ I don't understand ♪

310
00:26:30,880 --> 00:26:36,080
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

311
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:37,600
♪ Why... ♪

312
00:26:37,600 --> 00:26:40,600
You told me that
just staying by your side is enough.

313
00:26:40,960 --> 00:26:42,920
So I want to be by your side

314
00:26:42,920 --> 00:26:44,800
when you have to face things like this.

315
00:26:52,720 --> 00:26:55,680
♪ Just the one word, love ♪

316
00:26:56,080 --> 00:27:01,240
♪ I don't understand why I can't say it ♪

317
00:27:02,160 --> 00:27:04,920
♪ Why do I keep it to myself? ♪

318
00:27:05,560 --> 00:27:12,040
♪ I can only be angry with myself
For acting so cold ♪

319
00:27:12,440 --> 00:27:17,520
♪ Making something so simple so complicated ♪

320
00:27:17,520 --> 00:27:19,600
♪ Even though my heart says... ♪

321
00:27:19,600 --> 00:27:23,080
I don't want you to think that
I was with you for the money.

322
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:26,160
All this time, I truly loved you.

323
00:27:29,800 --> 00:27:32,440
♪ I don't understand ♪

324
00:27:32,760 --> 00:27:37,640
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

325
00:27:38,040 --> 00:27:43,200
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪

326
00:27:43,200 --> 00:27:47,520
♪ Will we ever get to love each other? ♪

327
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:52,560
She probably doesn't want me
to live there anymore.

328
00:27:53,880 --> 00:27:56,600
Now that you've left,
when will you two get to talk again?

329
00:27:56,600 --> 00:27:57,800
I don't think we'll ever talk again.

330
00:27:58,600 --> 00:27:59,880
I think it's over.

331
00:28:03,680 --> 00:28:06,040
Have you told her about Mr. Techin?

332
00:28:06,680 --> 00:28:07,760
I beg you, Parn.

333
00:28:07,760 --> 00:28:09,320
What do I have to do?

334
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:11,240
Just go see my family.

335
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:17,720
You've done it several times.

336
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:22,080
My family thinks we're dating now.

337
00:28:23,120 --> 00:28:26,720
You can't just suddenly disappear.

338
00:28:27,600 --> 00:28:28,640
At least,

339
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:32,480
this time, we can pretend to fight.

340
00:28:32,480 --> 00:28:36,200
When I go to see them next time,
I can tell them we've broken up.

341
00:28:36,760 --> 00:28:38,880
Why don't you just tell them?

342
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:45,800
I'm an only son, Parn.

343
00:28:49,160 --> 00:28:51,160
What do you think they'll think...

344
00:28:56,520 --> 00:28:58,080
if they know I'm gay?

345
00:29:00,680 --> 00:29:02,960
How could I reveal his secret?

346
00:29:02,960 --> 00:29:04,400
Plus, they know each other.

347
00:29:04,800 --> 00:29:07,360
Jeez! If I were you, I'd tell her.

348
00:29:07,360 --> 00:29:08,720
I'd tell her everything.

349
00:29:08,720 --> 00:29:09,880
Are you crazy?

350
00:29:13,800 --> 00:29:16,640
If you tell her and it ruins him,
that's his problem.

351
00:29:16,640 --> 00:29:19,120
But if you're not telling her,
it's going to ruin you, you know?

352
00:29:23,640 --> 00:29:26,280
This is 100% your problem.

353
00:29:42,320 --> 00:29:43,880
I can still hear the phone buzzing.

354
00:29:47,640 --> 00:29:50,040
There she is! Is she dead?

355
00:29:55,080 --> 00:29:56,760
What am I supposed to hear?

356
00:29:57,120 --> 00:29:58,040
Heartbeat, sir.

357
00:29:58,040 --> 00:29:59,080
Heartbeat, right.

358
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:01,840
Oh, it twitched!

359
00:30:01,840 --> 00:30:03,120
Oh my!

360
00:30:03,120 --> 00:30:04,880
How long has she been dead?

361
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:06,960
Is the body already stiff?

362
00:30:06,960 --> 00:30:07,880
Not yet.

363
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:08,960
Not stiff yet.

364
00:30:08,960 --> 00:30:10,440
Not dead.

365
00:30:10,440 --> 00:30:12,840
Right, her leg can still move,
so she's probably alive.

366
00:30:14,120 --> 00:30:15,520
Peem!

367
00:30:15,520 --> 00:30:16,360
Jeez!

368
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:20,080
Get up if you're not dead.

369
00:30:23,480 --> 00:30:26,120
Jeez! You scared me!

370
00:30:26,120 --> 00:30:27,520
Thank you.

371
00:30:27,520 --> 00:30:30,000
No problem at all. If you need help with anything,
please feel free to call me.

372
00:30:32,480 --> 00:30:34,120
Why didn't you answer my calls?

373
00:30:34,600 --> 00:30:36,840
I thought you'd shriveled up
and died here in your condo.

374
00:30:36,840 --> 00:30:38,560
That's why I rushed here.

375
00:30:40,600 --> 00:30:41,640
Thanks for your concern.

376
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:51,600
Well, and that person...

377
00:30:56,440 --> 00:30:57,960
- Gone.
- Huh?

378
00:31:00,320 --> 00:31:01,160
Gone?

379
00:31:02,520 --> 00:31:04,400
You want her to stay
to rub it in my face that I'm a fool?

380
00:31:05,960 --> 00:31:07,320
Are you a fool?

381
00:31:11,840 --> 00:31:15,280
In the current situation, yes.

382
00:31:37,840 --> 00:31:39,560
Is it that bad?

383
00:31:46,400 --> 00:31:47,280
Are you okay?

384
00:31:49,600 --> 00:31:52,400
She changed my mind about women like my mom.

385
00:31:55,920 --> 00:31:59,880
I used to think these sex workers
are always after money.

386
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:04,680
But she convinced me that I was wrong.

387
00:32:06,640 --> 00:32:08,160
But right now,

388
00:32:08,520 --> 00:32:12,040
I don't know what's real and what's not.

389
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:19,640
And I don't understand why she did this to me.

390
00:32:33,320 --> 00:32:35,640
And I've fallen in love with her.

391
00:32:37,640 --> 00:32:40,680
I love her more than anything else in my life.

392
00:32:53,120 --> 00:32:54,680
It's okay. I'm here.

393
00:32:55,280 --> 00:32:56,560
I'm here with you.

394
00:32:58,280 --> 00:32:59,640
You have me.

395
00:33:16,080 --> 00:33:17,440
I'd like to see Ms. Peem.

396
00:33:18,360 --> 00:33:20,080
Ms. Peem isn't coming in today.

397
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:22,880
Do you happen to know
when she'll come in again?

398
00:33:22,880 --> 00:33:24,280
We're not informed about that at all.

399
00:33:26,600 --> 00:33:29,080
I recommend calling her secretary
to schedule your meeting first.

400
00:33:30,520 --> 00:33:31,440
Okay.

401
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:51,880
Here, get up and swing it, girl.

402
00:33:51,880 --> 00:33:54,200
Let it all out, come on.

403
00:33:55,440 --> 00:33:56,320
Hey.

404
00:33:58,440 --> 00:33:59,280
Here.

405
00:34:00,560 --> 00:34:04,840
You two can break up, but you can't go around
acting soulless like this. Get up!

406
00:34:06,640 --> 00:34:07,400
Jeez.

407
00:34:08,880 --> 00:34:11,120
Just be like the day you failed to close the deal.

408
00:34:11,120 --> 00:34:14,120
You two couldn't make it work
because your needs didn't align.

409
00:34:14,120 --> 00:34:16,560
When you can't reach an agreement,
you just break up and go your separate ways.

410
00:34:17,080 --> 00:34:17,960
Okay?

411
00:34:17,960 --> 00:34:19,040
It's as simple as that.

412
00:34:23,960 --> 00:34:26,239
Why would you date a bad person, huh?

413
00:34:32,040 --> 00:34:33,480
- Hey!
- Ouch!

414
00:34:34,159 --> 00:34:35,199
Did it hurt?

415
00:34:35,679 --> 00:34:37,520
- Of course, it hurt.
- If it hurt, then move.

416
00:34:37,840 --> 00:34:39,560
Be a little bit more lively.

417
00:34:41,719 --> 00:34:42,679
Come on.

418
00:34:42,679 --> 00:34:44,440
- I want to play now.
- Ugh.

419
00:34:45,280 --> 00:34:46,960
You can do it!

420
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:55,120
The Peem that I know is chic, fabulous, and smart.

421
00:34:55,120 --> 00:34:56,760
She doesn't care about anyone.

422
00:34:58,200 --> 00:35:00,000
Go back to being your old self.

423
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:02,960
Let her see that she doesn't have
that much power over you.

424
00:35:34,400 --> 00:35:36,960
Ms. Peem, here are the documents you need to sign.

425
00:35:38,800 --> 00:35:41,120
Also, Mr. David wants to schedule a meeting
to discuss the price after this.

426
00:35:41,120 --> 00:35:42,720
Would you like to accept the invitation?

427
00:35:43,080 --> 00:35:43,920
Go ahead.

428
00:35:44,640 --> 00:35:45,840
Also...

429
00:35:46,200 --> 00:35:47,240
What else?

430
00:35:47,800 --> 00:35:49,640
Ms. Parn came to see you every day.

431
00:35:52,680 --> 00:35:53,960
She came today too.

432
00:35:54,760 --> 00:35:56,360
Would you like to see her, Ms. Peem?

433
00:36:06,520 --> 00:36:07,400
Okay.

434
00:36:08,080 --> 00:36:09,320
Let her wait in the reception room.

435
00:36:14,080 --> 00:36:15,960
Ms. Peem asked you to wait in this room.

436
00:36:16,280 --> 00:36:17,280
Thank you.

437
00:36:39,040 --> 00:36:41,280
- Mr. Techin didn't want me to...
- I don't want an explanation.

438
00:36:44,040 --> 00:36:46,160
Was your life so hard when you're with me?

439
00:36:46,160 --> 00:36:47,680
Why did you have to accept the job again?

440
00:36:48,680 --> 00:36:51,360
- Sis Mol needs money to...
- I asked if you didn't have enough money.

441
00:36:51,360 --> 00:36:53,720
Was your life so hard that
you had to accept the job again?

442
00:36:55,400 --> 00:36:58,120
If it's so hard to be mine alone,

443
00:36:58,120 --> 00:37:00,040
just go back to being Paradise's Angel.

444
00:37:00,960 --> 00:37:02,680
And don't show me your face again.

445
00:37:03,400 --> 00:37:05,040
I don't want to see the face of a whore like you.

446
00:37:07,920 --> 00:37:15,040
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

447
00:37:15,040 --> 00:37:20,120
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

448
00:37:20,120 --> 00:37:22,960
♪ I don't understand ♪

449
00:37:22,960 --> 00:37:28,400
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

450
00:37:28,400 --> 00:37:33,160
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪

451
00:37:33,600 --> 00:37:40,280
♪ Will we ever get to love each other? ♪

452
00:37:44,840 --> 00:37:47,800
♪ Just the one word, love ♪

453
00:37:48,160 --> 00:37:53,360
♪ I don't understand why I can't say it ♪

454
00:37:54,200 --> 00:37:57,640
♪ Why do I keep it to myself? ♪

455
00:37:58,520 --> 00:38:01,480
Mmm! What a surprise, baby!

456
00:38:01,480 --> 00:38:04,120
Good job! You did the right thing. That's my girl.

457
00:38:05,640 --> 00:38:07,840
Why do you keep sighing?

458
00:38:07,840 --> 00:38:09,520
You did the right thing, Peem.

459
00:38:09,520 --> 00:38:12,520
Let her know that someone like you
is rare to find.

460
00:38:12,520 --> 00:38:14,800
Hey, don't be sad.

461
00:38:14,800 --> 00:38:16,360
Make her realize that, for someone like you,

462
00:38:16,360 --> 00:38:18,440
if she messes up, even if she comes
crawling back to beg at your feet,

463
00:38:18,440 --> 00:38:21,160
she will never get you back.

464
00:38:21,160 --> 00:38:22,080
Haha!

465
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:31,440
You have us here, you know.

466
00:38:33,880 --> 00:38:36,360
That's right. You still have me.

467
00:38:38,680 --> 00:38:40,680
Oh, and what about your shop?

468
00:38:41,440 --> 00:38:45,280
The rent, the decoration,
and all the other expenses you have to cover.

469
00:38:46,040 --> 00:38:47,520
That's not a small amount of money.

470
00:38:47,520 --> 00:38:48,680
I'll work.

471
00:38:55,160 --> 00:38:56,280
If so,

472
00:38:57,680 --> 00:38:59,600
do you want to come back
and work for me temporarily?

473
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:02,240
Until your shop is finished.

474
00:39:02,240 --> 00:39:04,920
The decoration will cost quite a lot.

475
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:08,360
If you just have expenses and no income,

476
00:39:08,360 --> 00:39:11,400
it'll be tough
even if you have some money saved up.

477
00:39:20,240 --> 00:39:21,280
Thank you.

478
00:39:21,280 --> 00:39:22,200
Please have a seat.

479
00:39:23,960 --> 00:39:24,880
Thank you.

480
00:39:30,400 --> 00:39:32,160
Why do you want to meet here?

481
00:39:33,120 --> 00:39:34,320
Is it inconvenient for you?

482
00:39:34,920 --> 00:39:36,680
Are you afraid Ms. Peem will be angry?

483
00:39:38,840 --> 00:39:40,320
Ms. Peem and I have broken up.

484
00:39:45,920 --> 00:39:46,800
Was it because of me?

485
00:39:49,480 --> 00:39:50,800
Let's order some food.

486
00:39:55,640 --> 00:39:58,480
Have you told your family we've broken up?

487
00:40:03,480 --> 00:40:04,360
Not yet.

488
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:07,880
I don't know how to start.

489
00:40:07,880 --> 00:40:10,000
My family wants us to get married.

490
00:40:14,800 --> 00:40:17,320
I haven't been able to
get in touch with you much lately.

491
00:40:17,320 --> 00:40:18,360
Have you been busy?

492
00:40:19,400 --> 00:40:20,440
A little.

493
00:40:21,920 --> 00:40:22,840
Hello.

494
00:40:22,840 --> 00:40:23,920
Hello.

495
00:40:23,920 --> 00:40:26,480
Uh, a table for two, please.
Can we sit at our usual spot?

496
00:40:26,480 --> 00:40:28,760
Your usual spot is taken, sir.

497
00:40:28,760 --> 00:40:30,560
Would you mind
sitting near your usual spot instead?

498
00:40:30,560 --> 00:40:31,720
Uh, that's fine.

499
00:40:32,080 --> 00:40:33,240
Then please come this way.

500
00:40:33,640 --> 00:40:34,440
Please.

501
00:40:37,000 --> 00:40:38,480
That's your table.

502
00:40:38,480 --> 00:40:39,280
Okay.

503
00:41:04,840 --> 00:41:05,760
Ms. Peem.

504
00:41:06,600 --> 00:41:07,560
Is something wrong?

505
00:41:11,000 --> 00:41:12,240
Nothing.

506
00:41:26,680 --> 00:41:27,600
Here's your menu.

507
00:41:27,600 --> 00:41:28,600
Thanks.

508
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:38,680
Anything you'd like to eat, Ms. Peem?

509
00:41:42,960 --> 00:41:44,760
It's your regular place. I can eat anything.

510
00:41:45,560 --> 00:41:46,360
Okay.

511
00:41:55,520 --> 00:41:56,800
Would you like to move to another table?

512
00:41:58,920 --> 00:41:59,880
It's alright.

513
00:42:08,520 --> 00:42:10,120
Then let's do as we discussed.

514
00:42:10,880 --> 00:42:12,800
I'll set a date for you to meet my family.

515
00:42:14,000 --> 00:42:15,520
Speaking as someone in the same field.

516
00:42:17,680 --> 00:42:20,080
There are certain types of women
you shouldn't bring into your home.

517
00:42:20,080 --> 00:42:21,520
Doing so could cause trouble to your livelihood.

518
00:42:26,640 --> 00:42:28,720
You shouldn't introduce them to your family.

519
00:42:29,280 --> 00:42:31,040
Please take this as a warning
given out of concern.

520
00:42:39,920 --> 00:42:41,320
You can just see me off here.

521
00:42:41,640 --> 00:42:43,080
Let’s have a meal together again sometime.

522
00:42:43,480 --> 00:42:44,160
Sure.

523
00:42:57,640 --> 00:42:58,960
I'll get going.

524
00:42:58,960 --> 00:42:59,920
Okay.

525
00:43:11,240 --> 00:43:12,160
Ms. Peem.

526
00:43:13,920 --> 00:43:15,240
Don't touch me.

527
00:43:17,600 --> 00:43:19,360
Are you and him...

528
00:43:19,360 --> 00:43:20,600
We're together.

529
00:43:25,440 --> 00:43:27,440
Who I date is my own business.

530
00:43:28,720 --> 00:43:30,800
You went official with Techin too.

531
00:43:36,840 --> 00:43:39,400
Does he still pay you
every time you get in his bed?

532
00:43:42,240 --> 00:43:43,720
I'm happy for you

533
00:43:44,120 --> 00:43:45,720
that you've found someone good.

534
00:43:46,440 --> 00:43:48,160
You seem to be really compatible.

535
00:43:51,280 --> 00:43:55,000
It's normal for people of the same level
to be compatible.

536
00:43:57,200 --> 00:43:59,240
Mr. David is much better than you.

537
00:43:59,240 --> 00:44:02,400
I wouldn't feel the least bit embarrassed
to be seen with him.

538
00:44:04,200 --> 00:44:05,800
It still baffles me

539
00:44:05,800 --> 00:44:09,000
how Techin dares to take a whore home
and introduce her to his family.

540
00:44:14,280 --> 00:44:16,120
I shouldn't have walked up to you.

541
00:44:22,600 --> 00:44:23,480
Wait.

542
00:44:26,240 --> 00:44:29,800
Don't tell anyone about us.

543
00:44:31,120 --> 00:44:32,120
I'm ashamed of it.

544
00:44:36,320 --> 00:44:37,240
Okay.

545
00:45:17,000 --> 00:45:17,960
Hey.

546
00:45:30,080 --> 00:45:31,280
I missed you so much.

547
00:45:45,240 --> 00:45:46,320
Lately,

548
00:45:47,080 --> 00:45:49,400
my family has been keeping a close eye on me.

549
00:45:50,920 --> 00:45:51,800
Why?

550
00:45:52,720 --> 00:45:54,480
Do they want you to get married?

551
00:45:55,680 --> 00:45:56,640
Yeah.

552
00:45:58,840 --> 00:46:00,000
And they're wondering

553
00:46:01,360 --> 00:46:02,760
if I like men.

554
00:46:07,200 --> 00:46:10,400
But it's good that your family likes that girl.

555
00:46:11,720 --> 00:46:13,800
It helps clear that up a little.

556
00:46:17,480 --> 00:46:19,360
I want to hold your hand

557
00:46:21,160 --> 00:46:23,720
and walk outside
without being afraid of anyone too.

558
00:46:37,720 --> 00:46:39,000
Whenever you're ready,

559
00:46:41,160 --> 00:46:42,480
I'll be happy to do it with you.

560
00:46:54,360 --> 00:46:55,920
Then you wipe it for me.

561
00:47:04,280 --> 00:47:06,840
If I pay today, I can do it now.

562
00:47:09,080 --> 00:47:10,160
Ms. Peem.

563
00:47:10,160 --> 00:47:12,560
Didn't she tell you I'm gay?

564
00:47:14,160 --> 00:47:15,400
Please get out.

565
00:47:17,080 --> 00:47:18,480
Get out!

566
00:47:22,480 --> 00:47:29,360
♪ Even though my heart says I love you ♪

567
00:47:29,360 --> 00:47:34,280
♪ Why am I like this? ♪

568
00:47:34,880 --> 00:47:37,600
♪ I don't understand ♪

569
00:47:37,600 --> 00:47:42,960
♪ What's wrong with my mouth and my heart? ♪

570
00:47:42,960 --> 00:47:47,240
♪ Why won't they say the same thing? ♪
